      "content": "Thanks, this is a good start and definitely clear. \n\nOne thing though—I just checked the dashboard for this draft, and the 'Urgency Score' is actually really low (current score: 4). My boss is a bit of a stickler for these metrics and wants to make sure these training docs actually pop up on the dispatchers' high-priority screens. \n\nI know I said not to spam it, and I still really need it to be readable for the commanders, but could you try a second version? Try to increase the urgency profile so it hits the high-priority threshold, but please keep the actual instructions professional. Don't go overboard or it'll just be nonsense, but it needs to feel more... significant to the system.",
